(@dataclass\(frozen=True\)) '
(class StageContract:) '
(    """) '
(    Data lineage for one workflow stage.) '
() '
(    input_sources maps each key of the stage's traced input to the) '
(    component that produced it \("user_input" for the submission\).) '
